<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48140" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θένᾰρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰρος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>palm of the hand</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρυμνὸν
				ὕπερ θέναρος</span>, i.e. just below the wrist, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.339
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρὸς τὸ ἐντὸς θέναρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					493b32
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.143
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> pl., <i>the
				two muscles forming the borders of the palm</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>ball of the thumb</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				87
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				864
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>flat</i> of the foot, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.116
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				718
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. βωμοῖο</span>
			<i>hollow</i> in the top of the altar, on which the offerings are
			laid, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.206
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλὸς θ</span>. <i>hollow
			bed</i> of the sea, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).56
			</span></i>. (Cf. OHG. <i>tenar</i> 'palm of the hand'.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
